OL,3,GNEWSAWho are Northampton Town's new
OL,4,Aowners?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter almost a month of negotiations
OL,7,Fand legal formalities, the takeover of
OL,8,FNorthampton Town was completed on
OL,9,FWednesday.
OL,11,FSports Alpha Capital (SAC) will take a
OL,12,F70% shareholding in Northampton Town
OL,13,FVentures Limited (NTVL) - the company
OL,14,Fthat owns the majority of shares in the
OL,15,FLeague Two club.
OL,17,FSAC's Joao Xavier and Tim Chamberlain
OL,18,Fwill become co-chairmen, with former
OL,19,Ffootballer Alexandre Pato due to join
OL,20,Fthe board as a director.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
