OL,3,GNEWSAWho are Northampton Town's new
OL,4,Aowners?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe takeover will see current owner
OL,7,FKelvin Thomas step down as chairman
OL,8,Fafter more than a decade in the role,
OL,9,Fthough he - along with co-owners David
OL,10,FBower and Nigel Le Quesne - will remain
OL,11,Fas shareholders and directors.
